FR:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Oh, {{TAG:0005:0000:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Je ne savais pas que tu vivais ici !{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Tu te souviens de moi au moins ?
Mon nom c'est {{TAG:0005:0001:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Eh bien !
Si je m'attendais à te voir dans ma
nouvelle ville... 
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}On se reverra bientôt, j'espère,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Aaa, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Burada yaşadığını bilmiyordum!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Beni unutmadın, değil mi?
Ben {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yeni kasabamda seninle
karşılaşacağımı hiç beklemiyordum! {{TAG:0003:0027:}}Artık
görüşürüz buralarda,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Yes!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} I finally found you, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}I've been looking all over for you
ever since I moved here!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}We've gotta hang out more,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Ah !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Enfin ! {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Je te trouve enfin !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}J'arrête pas de te chercher partout{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
depuis que j'ai emménagé en ville !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Maintenant qu'on est voisins, toi et
moi il faut qu'on se voie plus
souvent ! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Evet!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Sonunda seni buldum, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Buraya taşındığımdan beri her yerde
seni arıyordum!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Artık daha çok takılalım,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Wann bist du denn hergezogen?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Wie?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Du hast schon immer hier
gewohnt?
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Dann bin ja nur ich der Neue hier!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Dabei bin ich schon vor 'ner ganzen
Weile aus {{TAG:0011:0002:0000}} hergezogen.
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Egal!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Schön, dich wieder zu treffen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Oh nein!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ich seh da {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Das muss ein Fiebertraum sein!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich bin wohl kränker, als ich dachte.
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Du bist es ja WIRKLICH, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Wohnst du etwa auch in {{TAG:0005:0006:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich bin {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Weißt du noch?
Ich bin gerade erst hergezogen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Tja, beim Umzug muss ich mich
dann erkältet haben.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:001E:}}Ha--{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}TSCHIII!
Schnief...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Wir können ja mal was
unternehmen, wenn ich wieder
gesund bin,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Hallihallo, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Das ist ja nett von dir, extra wegen
mir herzukommen!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ich bin frisch eingezogen und fühl
mich hier noch nicht so ganz zu
Hause.
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Wie schön, {{TAG:000E:0006:1800650069006E0065006E00200046007200650075006E0064001A00650069006E006500200046007200650075006E00640069006E00}} zu sehen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Komm bitte bald wieder vorbei.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Versprichst du das,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Huch?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Das ist ja wie in alten Zeiten,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}...
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Versprichst du mir, mich bald
wieder besuchen zu kommen?

{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Hallöchen,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Kommst du vorbei, weil du dir
Sorgen um mich gemacht hast?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Äh, he he he!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Das ist ja echt nett.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Aber schau mal!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ich komm hier
wunderbar zurecht,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hey,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
It's been a while!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0023:}}Are you surprised
at how much I've matured?
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}It's true.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I've gotten a little taller{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
and a LOT heftier.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:001A:}}Moving makes
me even hungrier than usual.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ehi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Quanto tempo!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0023:}}Non ti stupisce
vedere quanto sono cresciuto?
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}È vero!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sono un po' più alto{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
e molto più massiccio.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:001A:}}Il trasloco
mi ha stimolato un sacco l'appetito!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hey,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Görüşmeyeli epey oldu!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0023:}}Ne kadar
olgunlaştığıma şaşırdın mı?
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Doğru.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Biraz boy attım{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ve ÇOK daha tombullaştım.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:001A:}}Taşınmak
beni normalden bile daha çok acıktırıyor.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Whoa,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} it's {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I wasn't expecting to see you here!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I just moved here, and I've been
kind of worried about settling in
and making new friends.
I still need to get my place set up{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
and mentally prepare myself for
meeting new people.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}But{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} seeing you here is making me
feel lots better!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Yeah!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I'm gonna meet the heck out
of everyone in {{TAG:0005:0005:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Wow,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} das ist ja {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Damit hätte ich jetzt echt nicht
gerechnet!
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Na ja, ich bin neu hier und hab
noch nicht so viele Freunde...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Mein Haus ist auch noch das reinste
Chaos.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Da ist es doch peinlich,
wenn ich jemanden einlade.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ah, es tut gut, {{TAG:000E:0006:2400650069006E0065006E00200061006C00740065006E00200046007200650075006E0064002400650069006E006500200061006C0074006500200046007200650075006E00640069006E00}}
zu treffen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}} Ach, Chaos hin oder her,
ich lade trotzdem Leute ein!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Vay,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} bu {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Seni burada görmeyi hiç
beklemiyordum!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Daha yeni taşındım;
buraya alışmak ve
yeni arkadaş edinmek konusunda biraz endişeliydim.
Evi de hâlâ yerleştirmem gerekiyor{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ve yeni insanlarla tanışmaya
zihnen hazırlanmalıyım.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ama{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} seni burada görmek içimi çok
rahatlattı!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Evet!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}'daki
herkesle çatır çatır
tanışacağım!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Diesen Geruch kenn ich doch...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}So riecht nur {{TAG:0005:0006:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Äh, he he he!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ich hab vielleicht ein
Hirn wie ein Sieb, aber mein Riecher
vergisst so leicht nichts!
Wie nett, dich wiederzusehen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Guarda chi si vede...
{{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Non ti ricordi di me?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Sono io,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Sei qui in visita, giusto?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Beh, adesso
io vivo proprio in questa città.
Che strana coincidenza!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Roba da non credere, sul serio!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Pensi che sia un segno del destino,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}I knew you'd never forget your
old pal{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:000B:}}Though, to be
honest, I forget where we met.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Anyway, I just moved here today.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
It's good seeing you again,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Eski dostun{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0001:}}'ı asla unutmayacağını
biliyordum!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:000B:}}Gerçi dürüst olayım,
nerede tanıştığımızı ben unuttum.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Neyse, bugün buraya taşındım.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Seni yeniden görmek güzel,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ay,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡venga ya!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Soy {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Y te aseguro que nos conocemos,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bueno, pues es que me he mudado
hoy a este pueblo.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Nos vamos a ver,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡así que no vuelvas a olvidarme!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Su,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} dai!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sono {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ci siamo già conosciuti, ne sono
certo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Beh, mi sono trasferito oggi e credo{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
che ci vedremo spesso d'ora in poi.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Cerca di non dimenticarti più di me!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Amaan,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} hadi ama!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ben {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hem daha önce kesin karşılaştık,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Neyse, bugün kasabaya yeni taşındım.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Buralarda görüşeceğiz,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
o yüzden beni bir daha unutma!
